    "detailed_description": "In \u201cJoe's Life,\u201d you and your best friend Halliday honor his grandpa\u2019s last wish by opening a record store. This is a story driven game where you go through various obstacles in order to open a record store. Within this endeavor you meet many unique and colorful characters, make new friends, and explore interesting locations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A Emo Cat</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A Heartwarming Story About Death, And Enjoying Life </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The Art, Music, And Gameplay Is All Made By One Guy</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>And Most importantly, The Game Is Made With Love </li></ul></h2>",
